  m_text: '<color=#A6F23F><b>1  BUILD & CHECKOUT</b></color>

    Place towers and
    garrison, then commit the town draft.


    <color=#31C2FF><b>2  DEPLOY A SNAPSHOT</b></color>

    Review
    the immutable defense copy other players will raid.


    <color=#FF4D6B><b>3 
    RAID FOR WAR GEMS</b></color>

    Pick a target, inspect stake and payout, control
    your Hero, then extract or destroy the Core.


    <color=#A3B2C6>Defense reports
    unlock Replay and Revenge when verified.</color>'
